 t person to arrive will get the zoom link up on the room's computer.\nCour
 se: MED 511\n\nInstructors:\n	Linda Sun (lsun3)\n\nMy Group:\n	Name: TBL 1
 6\n	Location: Katz 1078\n\nObjectives:\n	Construct a differential diagnosi
 s for anemia based on the MCV and reticulocyte count.\n	Select appropriate
  diagnostic tests for causes of macrocytic and microcytic anemia.\n	Apply 
 clinical practice guidelines for iron deficiency anemia.\n	Differentiate b
 etween disorders of primary or secondary coagulation.\n	Develop a differen
 tial diagnosis for coagulopathy.\n	Select appropriate investigations for c
 oagulopathy.\n\nView this event online: https://calendar.med.ualberta.ca/e
 vents/198760
